    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Choose one of the Dead Three: Bane, Bhaal, or Myrkul. You gain Resistance to one damage type and the ability to cast a cantrip, as shown in the table below; Intelligence is your spellcasting ability for this cantrip. When you finish a Long Rest, you can change your choice.</p><table><thead><tr><th>God</th><th>Damage Resistance</th><th>Cantrip</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bane</td><td>Psychic</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMinorIllus]{Minor Illusion}</td></tr><tr><td>Bhaal</td><td>Poison</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.spells.Item.52K6rs5zHagiRUsB]{Blade Ward}</td></tr><tr><td>Myrkul</td><td>Necrotic</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplChillTouch]{Chill Touch}</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Z4Mo4zbKHJfObARn\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the effect of your god only. If you change your god, replace the cantrip too.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
